      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Having this accessible to Udon is a minimum compromise if user near clip override is going to persist between worlds since extremely low near clip can break shaders and geometry (especially highly-optimized geometry) which breaks accessibility considerations in a world’s presentation. This is especially important for worlds using scripts to fix user comfort in stations (requiring a minimum distance between head and hip bones to work) and Sacc Flight worlds where far clip needs to be pushed as far as it can because of the nature of how flying works.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
