      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5cdfbadfb6769f15acd2e42e|full_name} this was not implemented as a compromise and its been a disaster since then because they didnt provide a way to override settings.\n\nVRChat, why did you implement this in a manner that breaks worlds by default even after it was brought up! This is the worst thing that has ever happened to world development on this platform, and there need to be Answers!",
